OL,3,GNEWSABrass band room 'trashed in
OL,4,Adevastating break-in'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA youth brass band has been left
OL,7,Fdevastated after its rehearsal space
OL,8,Fwas broken into and "trashed" over the
OL,9,Fbank holiday weekend, its leaders say.
OL,11,FCamborne Youth Brass Band's musical
OL,12,Fdirector was alerted to the incident in
OL,13,FTuckingmill, Cornwall, by police at
OL,14,Fabout 18:00 BST on Saturday.
OL,16,FA spokesperson for Devon and Cornwall
OL,17,FPolice said entry "was forced", with
OL,18,F"considerable damage caused to the
OL,19,Fbuilding's structure and contents `
OL,20,Fincluding a band's musical equipment".
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
