OL,3,GNEWSABrass band room 'trashed in
OL,4,Adevastating break-in'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree 12-year-old girls and two
OL,7,F12-year-old boys were detained at the
OL,8,Fscene and inquiries were ongoing,
OL,9,Fpolice said.
